<title>UK: CRICKET-PAKISTAN'S NAZIR JOINS ENGLISH CLUB KENDAL.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN'S NAZIR JOINS ENGLISH CLUB KENDAL.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan seamer Shahid Nazir will join English Northern League side Kendal as their cricket professional for the 1997 season.</p>
<p>Nazir, who captured five for 54 on his test debut against Zimbabwe two weeks ago, replaces South African Meyrick Pringle.</p>
<p>Nazir, 21, led the Pakistani bowling averages during this year's tour of England, although he was unable to break into the test side.</p>
</text>
